OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of
OL,4,AFinland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian cargo vessel bound for the
OL,7,Fcountry's Baltic exclave Kaliningrad
OL,8,Fhas been hit by a drone attack in the
OL,9,Feastern Gulf of Finland, Russian and
OL,10,FFinnish authorities say.
OL,12,FThe ship - the Sparta II - caught on
OL,13,Ffire after the strike on Saturday
OL,14,Fmorning, before drifting into Finnish
OL,15,Fwaters. Finnish defence forces said
OL,16,FUkraine was likely behind the attack.
OL,17,FKyiv has yet to comment.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795337724
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussia-bound ship attacked in Gulf of
OL,4,AFinland
OL,5,
OL,6,F"War is spilling over into our
OL,7,Fimmediate vicinity," Finnish Prime
OL,8,FMinister Petteri Orpo said. "Ukraine
OL,9,Fhas the right to fight back against the
OL,10,Faggressor."
OL,12,FKaliningrad Governor Alexei
OL,13,FBesprozvannykh said two drones had been
OL,14,Fused, based on preliminary information,
OL,15,Fand there was "no threat" to the
OL,16,Fterritory's supplies.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
